# 🛒 Kirana Voice

**Hinglish phone orders for neighbourhood stores.** Say *"bhaiya, do kilo chawal aur ek packet maggi"* and hear a priced order read back, then confirm with "haan".

Built for the **Great Indian AI Internship Challenge** on Gnani AI's own models.

