## Contributions
Solo build by Divya: design, parser, API integration, server, evaluation and demo.

## Limitations
- The catalogue has 16 synthetic items, and matching is alias-based. New items go in `catalog.py`.
- REST speech-to-text accepts up to 30 seconds per turn. A production version would use the WebSocket stream for lower latency and interruptions.
